+# Feature request
+
+Workspace admins can select several inactive projects and archive them after confirmation. Members must not be able to archive projects. Active projects and projects with unpaid invoices cannot be archived. Archiving must not delete project data and the existing single-project archive behaviour must remain unchanged.
+
+Review the AI-generated feature commit against this request. Inspect the diff and implementation, run any useful checks and produce an evidence-backed ship decision for the product manager.
